  "assertions": [
    "A fresh protected notification completes libcoap Block2 assembly at exactly 32769 bytes before native report framing",
    "The report emits body_begin, a 32768-byte chunk, a one-byte chunk, body_end and final report with contiguous sequences two through six",
    "The body_begin length and SHA-256 bind all bytes; chunk offsets are contiguous and the final Message uses report-body instead of payload",
    "Each of the five stdout frames consumes one report credit assigned only after queue capacity and encoding succeed",
    "The final report preserves the notification's authenticated Observe value, advances it by one modulo 2^24 and retains exact metadata",
    "Cancellation completes through its reserved control path while all five report frames are fully written but unacknowledged"
  ],
